WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
Faseeh: gyara karatunka cikin minti ɗaya.

1
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.650
Zaɓi surar da kake son karantawa.

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.800
Za ka iya zaɓar ayoyi: danna ayar farko, sannan ayar ƙarshe.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.800
Idan ba ka zaɓi komai ba, za ka karanta surar gaba ɗaya.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.800
Danna “Saurari mai karatu” don jin ayoyin da muryar Shaikh Muhammad Siddiq al-Minshawi.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Ana haskaka kalmar da ake karantawa yayin da kake saurare.

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.500
Danna “Fara rikodi”, ka karanta da murya bayyananniya, sannan ka dakatar da rikodin.

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.100
Faseeh yana nazarin karatunka cikin ’yan daƙiƙoƙi.

8
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:33.500
Za ka ga yawan kalmomin da suka yi daidai, kuma ana haskaka kalmar da ke da kuskure.

9
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:41.600
Danna kalmar don ganin yadda ake furta ta daidai a rubuce, da makhrajin harafin a hoto.

10
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:48.400
Saurare ta da muryar makaranci: kalmar kaɗai, ko ayar gaba ɗaya.

11
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.400
“Kunna rikodina” yana sake kunna karatunka don ka kwatanta.

12
00:00:52.400 --> 00:01:00.100
A “Furucin kalma” za ka koyi furta kowace kalma ba tare da rikodi ba.

13
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:05.000
Ana samun Faseeh a cikin harsuna goma sha uku.

14
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.500
Faseeh samfurin basirar wucin gadi ne da zai iya kuskure; ba ya maye gurbin gogaggen malami.
